:["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YqN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"268d4d83-d968-4af0-b2d1-c5fd6d4d031c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"短く本質のみを伝えようとするのは自分の理解にとっても良いですからね","ts":"1636035991.357900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jct"}]},{"client_msg_id":"deaa00db-9ceb-41e2-8e8b-e2a68bf8970c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なんやかんやでアウトプットは学習効率がよい","ts":"1636034895.354300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mUCe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b67bf20-bace-4606-90f6-5d185b285eff","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"発表はすればするほどよい（？）","ts":"1636034664.353600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Qb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4dc8c8b-095b-4e1b-ac7d-55845643ae8a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"つまりVimのイベントにガンガン登壇していくといいと(そうじゃない)","ts":"1636034587.353200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z+gk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1846123d-f89a-4697-afdc-9173464f148b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"同じような教育を受けていても学会発表たくさんしてる学生のほうが優秀に感じるんですけど、だいたいこれで説明つくのかもしれないと思いました\n卒論修論のような長い文章より学会予稿みたいに短く全部入り文章のほうがたくさん赤入れられるから経験値効率が良い\n（学会出るのが重くない分野からの意見です）","ts":"1636034480.352700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RSs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca247d56-aed5-4ad0-b2ec-2e0eca5fb4af","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ここでの発言とかも割と間違ったこと言ってたりするけど、それを指摘してもらえるのはありがたいことだよな、と","ts":"1636034304.349400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022XK